        "content": "<p>alexcrichton opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15036\">issue #15036</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This test:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"WebAssembly\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">module</span> <span class=\"nv\">$M</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">type</span> <span class=\"nv\">$t</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">result</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">table</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"t\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span> <span class=\"k\">funcref</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">table</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"a\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span> <span class=\"err\">anyref</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"call\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">param</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">result</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">call_indirect</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">type</span> <span class=\"nv\">$t</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">local.get</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"get-a\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">param</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">result</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">i</span><span class=\"mi\">31</span><span class=\"err\">.get_s</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">ref.cast</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">ref</span> <span class=\"err\">i</span><span class=\"mi\">31</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">table.get</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">local.get</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">))))))</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">register</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"M\"</span> <span class=\"nv\">$M</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">assert_trap</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">module</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">type</span> <span class=\"nv\">$a</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">array</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span> <span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">import</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"M\"</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"t\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">table</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span> <span class=\"k\">funcref</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">table</span> <span class=\"nv\">$t2</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span> <span class=\"err\">anyref</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$f</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">result</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">elem</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">table</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$f</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">elem</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">table</span> <span class=\"nv\">$t2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"err\">anyref</span>\n      <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">array.new_default</span> <span class=\"nv\">$a</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mf\">0x7fffffff)</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n  <span class=\"s2\">\"allocation size too large\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">assert_trap</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">invoke</span> <span class=\"nv\">$M</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"call\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">))</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"uninitialized element\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>fails with:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cargo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Error</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">failed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">script</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">'</span><span class=\"na\">foo</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"o\">'</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">Caused</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">by</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">failed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">directive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">on</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">21</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">expected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trap</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">got</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Core</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">I32</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)])</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>and the same with the trap in a later element of the same segment:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"WebAssembly\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">assert_trap</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">module</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">type</span> <span class=\"nv\">$a</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">array</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span> <span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">import</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"M\"</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"a\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">table</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span> <span class=\"err\">anyref</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">elem</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">table</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"err\">anyref</span>\n      <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">ref.i</span><span class=\"mi\">31</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n      <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">array.new_default</span> <span class=\"nv\">$a</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mf\">0x7fffffff)</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n  <span class=\"s2\">\"allocation size too large\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">assert_trap</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">invoke</span> <span class=\"nv\">$M</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"get-a\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">))</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"null reference\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cargo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Error</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">failed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">script</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">'</span><span class=\"na\">foo</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"o\">'</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">Caused</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">by</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">failed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">directive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">on</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">19</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">expected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trap</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">got</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Core</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">I32</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">)])</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The spec's <a href=\"https://webassembly.github.io/spec/core/exec/modules.html#exec-instantiation\">instantiation</a> evaluates the element expressions of every segment before running any active segment's <code>table.init</code>, so a trapping expression should leave imported tables untouched.</p>\n<p>Fixing this in my opinion is going to need to be balanced with implementation complexity. This is a vanishingly niche use case which in theory shouldn't come along with a large implementation burden. Nevertheless I figured it's worth opening here.</p>\n</blockquote>",
